splay":"Sep 06","superTitle":null,"isHidden":false,"primaryCollectionSlug":null,"isAvailableForPersonalTheater":false},{"slug":"terror-tuesday-angel-heart","legacySlug":null,"show":{"slug":"angel-heart","legacySlug":null,"title":"Angel Heart","vistaHoCodes":["A000024921"],"headline":"Go down south with Mickey Rourke in this atmospheric thriller.","landscapeHeroImage":{"uri":"https://img-assets.drafthouse.com/images/shows/angel-heart/ANGEL-HEART_hero-copy.jpg?auto=compress&crop=focalpoint&fit=crop&fp-x=0.5&fp-y=0.5&h=1080&q=80&w=1920","altText":"ANGEL HEART"},"portraitHeroImage":{"uri":"https://img-assets.drafthouse.com/images/shows/angel-heart/ANGEL-HEART_portrait-copy.jpg?auto=compress&crop=focalpoint&fit=crop&fp-x=0.5&fp-y=0.5&h=1440&q=80&w=1080","altText":"ANGEL HEART"},"posterImages":[{"uri":"https://img-assets.drafthouse.com/images/shows/angel-heart/ANGEL-HEART_sp-poster.jpg?auto=compress&fit=clip&h=1620&q=80&w=1080","altText":"ANGEL HEART"}],"certification":"R"},"event":{"slug":"terror-tuesday-angel-heart","title":"<show-title>Angel Heart</show-title>","eventTypeSlug":"special-event","eventTypeTitleOverride":null,"headline":"It will scare you to your very soul","description":"<p>Veterans of the British TV commercials industry made some pretty strong contributions to the fright-film scene between the late '70s and early '90s: Ridley Scott gave us ALIEN, Adrian Lyne helmed JACOB'S LADDER, and Alan Parker got scary with ANGEL HEART.</p>\n<p>Based on William Hjortsberg's novel <em>Fallen Angel</em> and set in the '50s, the film follows P.I. Harry Angel (Mickey Rourke) as he ventures into an occult underworld in search of a missing singer named Johnny Favorite, at the behest of Robert De Niro's mysterious Louis Cyphre. The film became notorious at the time of its release for a blood-drenched sex scene between Angel and Favorite's daughter, Epiphany Proudfoot – particularly since she was played by Lisa Bonet, star of the wholesome TV hit <em>The Cosby Show</em> – th